:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(13,11,'Backpacks & Rucksacks','backpacks-rucksacks','Structured commuter backpacks with padded laptop sleeves.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548036328-c9fa89d128fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Briefcase',2,1,0,'Backpacks & Rucksacks - Boutique','Structured commuter backpacks with padded laptop sleeves.','2026-10-12 05:21:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(14,11,'Wallets & Cardholders','wallets-cardholders','Slim bifold wallets and tactile pebble-grain card sleeves.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548036328-c9fa89d128fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Briefcase',3,1,0,'Wallets & Cardholders - Boutique','Slim bifold wallets and tactile pebble-grain card sleeves.','2026-10-12 05:21:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(15,NULL,'Footwear','footwear','Ergonomic soles and understated silhouettes designed for city walking.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549298916-b41d501d3772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Footprints',4,1,1,'Footwear - Mindfully Sourced Collection','Ergonomic soles and understated silhouettes designed for city walking.','2026-10-12 05:21:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(16,15,'Everyday Sneakers','everyday-sneakers','Minimal low-tops with natural rubber cupsoles.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549298916-b41d501d3772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Footprints',1,1,0,'Everyday Sneakers - Boutique','Minimal low-tops with natural rubber cupsoles.','2026-10-12 05:21:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(17,15,'Leather Loafers','leather-loafers','Hand-stitched penny loafers with cushioned insoles.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549298916-b41d501d3772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Footprints',2,1,0,'Leather Loafers - Boutique','Hand-stitched penny loafers with cushioned insoles.','2026-10-12 05:21:04','2026-10-12 05:21:04'),(18,15,'Mules & Slides','mules-slides','Slip-on leather mules for effortless indoor and outdoor ease.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549298916-b41d501d3772?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80','Footp